This partial example assumes `v5WalletId`, `v5Seqno`, `validUntil`, `v5PrivateKey`, and `actions` are defined for the target V5 wallet. Replace `<V4_MNEMONIC>` with the valid mnemonic for the funded V4 sender and `<V5_WALLET_ADDRESS>` with the target address.

